===================================================================
1. SCOPE / ALCANCE
===================================================================

This licence covers everything in this repository EXCEPT two bodies of
third-party material: the font software under `fonts/` (section 3) and the
vendored libraries under `ui_kits/website/vendor/` (section 4).

Covered material includes, without limitation: the design tokens in
`colors_and_type.css`; the logos, isotypes, wordmarks, product glyphs
and lockups under `assets/` and `products/`; the brand voice, rules and
non-negotiables in `docs/`; the component
specifications; the preview specimens; the UI kit under `ui_kits/` (except
its `vendor/` directory); the
MCP server under `aglaya-ds-mcp/`; and the tooling under `tools/`,
`scripts/` and `bin/`.

Esta licencia cubre todo el repositorio EXCEPTO dos conjuntos de material
de terceros: las tipografías de `fonts/` (sección 3) y las librerías
vendorizadas de `ui_kits/website/vendor/` (sección 4).

===================================================================
2. RIGHTS GRANTED / DERECHOS CONCEDIDOS
===================================================================

None. No permission is granted to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, sublicense or sell the covered material, in whole or in
part, by any party other than the copyright holder and the surfaces the
copyright holder operates.

Ninguno. Salvo el titular del copyright y las superficies que opera, no
se concede permiso para usar, copiar, modificar, publicar, distribuir,
sublicenciar ni vender este material.

This repository is public for one operational reason: so that AGLAYA's
own surfaces can install `@aglaya/design-tokens` from a continuous
integration environment that clones only the consumer's repository and
cannot hold credentials for this one. Public visibility is a delivery
mechanism, not an invitation to reuse.

Que el repositorio sea público es un mecanismo de entrega, no una
invitación a reutilizarlo.

