The font software under `fonts/` belongs to its respective authors and
is redistributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. This
licence neither covers it nor may restrict it.

  Inter        Copyright 2017-2019 The Inter project authors
               fonts/LICENSE-Inter.txt
  Outfit       Copyright 2021 The Outfit Project Authors
               fonts/LICENSE-Outfit.txt
  Space Mono   Copyright 2016 The Space Mono Project Authors
               fonts/LICENSE-SpaceMono.txt

Each licence text is distributed verbatim beside the font files, as the
OFL requires. See `fonts/README.md`.

===================================================================
4. VENDORED LIBRARIES / LIBRERÍAS VENDORIZADAS — third-party, NOT covered
===================================================================

The JavaScript under `ui_kits/website/vendor/` belongs to its respective
authors and is redistributed under the MIT licence. This licence neither
covers it nor may restrict it. It is vendored, and not loaded from a CDN,
so the kit renders with no network and no third-party request.

  React 18.3.1      Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates.
                    ui_kits/website/vendor/LICENSE-react.txt
  ReactDOM 18.3.1   Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates.
                    ui_kits/website/vendor/LICENSE-react-dom.txt
  Babel 7.24.0      Copyright (c) 2014-present Sebastian McKenzie and
                    other contributors
                    ui_kits/website/vendor/LICENSE-babel.txt

Each licence text is distributed verbatim beside the file it covers, as
the MIT licence requires. A vendored file without its licence beside it
is a licence breach, so `tools/guard_paquete.py` fails on one.

