-------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on future terms: opening a licence is one commit; closing one is
not, because a permission already published stays published for that
version. These terms start closed on purpose. Under the versioning
policy in docs/PACKAGE.md, withdrawing or narrowing a licence that has
already shipped is a MAJOR release.
